{"speciesId":238,"names":{"fr":"Lippouti","es":"Smoochum","en":"Smoochum","ja":"ムチュール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its lips are the most sensitive parts on its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It always rocks its head slowly backwards and for­ wards as if it is trying to kiss someone."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The sensitivity of its lips develops most quickly. It uses them to try to identify unknown objects."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SMOOCHUM actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SMOOCHUM actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It actively runs about, but also falls often. Whenever it falls, it will check its reflection on a lake’s surface to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It always rocks its head slowly backwards and forwards as if it is trying to kiss someone."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its lips are the most sensitive parts on its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its lips are the most sensitive part of its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It always rocks its head slowly backwards and forwards as if it is trying to kiss someone."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il goûte à tout du bout des lèvres. Elles gardent en mémoire ses goûts et ses dégoûts."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il goûte à tout du bout des lèvres. Elles gardent en mémoire ses goûts et ses dégoûts."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses lèvres sont la partie la plus sensible de son corps. Il les utilise pour examiner les objets."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus labios son la parte más sensible de su cuerpo. Siempre los usa para examinar las cosas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its lips are the most sensitive part of its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"唇が 一番 敏感。 なんでも まず 唇で 触れて どんなものか 確認する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il goûte à tout du bout des lèvres. Elles gardent en mémoire ses goûts et ses dégoûts."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Analiza todo tocándolo con los labios. Así puede recordar las cosas que le gustan y disgustan."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"なんでも 唇で 触れてみて 確かめる。好きな 物も 嫌いな 物も 唇が 覚えている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lippouti court dans tous les sens et tombe assez souvent. Quand il en a l’occasion, il regarde son reflet dans l’eau pour vérifier si son visage n’a pas été sali par ses chutes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Smoochum va corriendo por todos lados, pero se cae también con frecuencia. Y, en cuanto tiene ocasión, se mira en algún sitio para ver si se ha manchado la cara."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Smoochum actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"元気 いっぱい 動き回るが よく 転ぶ。 むっくり 起き上がると 湖の 水面に 顔を 映して 汚れていないか 調べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lippouti court dans tous les sens et tombe assez souvent. Quand il en a l’occasion, il regarde son reflet dans l’eau pour vérifier si son visage n’a pas été sali par ses chutes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Smoochum va corriendo por todos lados, pero se cae también con frecuencia. Y, en cuanto tiene ocasión, se mira en algún sitio para ver si se ha manchado la cara."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Smoochum actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"元気 いっぱい 動き回るが よく 転ぶ。 むっくり 起き上がると 湖の 水面に 顔を 映して 汚れていないか 調べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Avant même de toucher de ses mains un objet qui l’intéresse, il le tâte de ses lèvres. S’il est sale, il le lèche au passage pour le nettoyer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando quiere examinar algo, lo toca con los labios antes que con las manos. Si está sucio, limpia la mugre lamiendo repetidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When it examines things, before touching them with its hands, it makes lip contact and then diligently licks all the dirt off its lips."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"なにかを 確かめるときは 手 より 先に 唇で 触れてみる。 こまめに 舐めて 汚れを 落とす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses lèvres sont des détecteurs hypersensibles. Il les enduit de sève tous les jours pour les garder hydratées et éviter les gerçures."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los labios son la parte más sensible de su cuerpo. Para que no se le cuarteen, los mantiene hidratados a diario con savia de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Highly perceptive sensors, Smoochum’s lips are kept moist by its daily application of tree sap."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"唇は 敏感な センサー。 荒れないように 木の 樹液を 毎日 塗って 保湿しているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand il s’aperçoit que son visage est sale, il le lave à l’eau, mais la propreté du reste de son corps ne semble pas le préoccuper."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En cuanto se le ensucia la cara, aunque sea un poco, se la lava con agua. En el resto del cuerpo, la suciedad no parece importarle mucho."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If its face gets even slightly dirty, Smoochum will bathe immediately. But if its body gets dirty, Smoochum doesn’t really seem to care."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ちょっとでも 顔が 汚れると 水浴び。 体の 汚れは あまり 気にしていないみたい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon très curieux touche tout et n’importe quoi avec ses lèvres pour déterminer ce qu’il aime et ce qu’il déteste."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Este Pokémon rebosante de curiosidad lo toca todo con los labios para determinar qué cosas le gustan y cuáles no."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This is a very curious Pokémon. Smoochum decides what it likes and dislikes by touching things with its lips."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"好奇心旺盛な ポケモン。 なんでも 唇で 触れてみて 好きか 嫌いかを 決めている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":238,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[3,"level-up